  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint (+1) or moderate (+2/+3) Fate; <strong>CL</strong> 3rd (+1), 6th (+2), or 9th (+3)<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> any; <strong>Price</strong> 2,500 gp (+1), 10,000 gp (+2), or 22,500 (+3); <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p>This crystal has been carefully woven into cloth and is designed to be worn anywhere on the body. While worn, a fragment of destiny provides a +1 to +3 luck bonus to all saving throws.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Charm, Fate sphere, <strong>Cost</strong> 1,250 gp (+1), 5,000 gp (+2), or 11,250 gp (+3)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/charms#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
